ols\",\n    75→    \"description\": \"Windsurf v1.42 (March 17, 2025) added Claude 3.7 Sonnet model support and introduced model selection controls for teams and enterprise plans, allowing admins to select which models are available to team members.\",\n    76→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    77→    \"url\": \"https://windsurf.com/changelog/vscode\",\n    78→    \"date\": \"2025-03-17\",\n    79→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    80→  },\n    81→  {\n    82→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n    83→    \"title\": \"Windows VM Support and Improved Feedback Controls\",\n    84→    \"description\": \"Devin expanded to support building, running, and testing natively in Windows VMs, bringing autonomous AI engineering to Windows developer ecosystem. Also introduced improved feedback controls with always-visible thumbs-up/down buttons and enhanced session-level feedback modal.\",\n    85→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    86→    \"url\": \"https://cognition.ai/blog\",\n    87→    \"date\": \"2025-06-01\",\n    88→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    89→  },\n    90→  {\n    91→    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    92→    \"title\": \"No specific updates in June 2025 timeframe\",\n    93→    \"description\": \"Based on available information, no major updates were specifically documented for Claude Code in the June 2025 timeframe. The product launched as a research preview in February 2025 and continued incremental updates throughout the year.\",\n    94→    \"updateType\": \"announcement\",\n    95→    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\",\n    96→    \"date\": \"2025-06-01\",\n    97→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    98→  },\n    99→  {\n   100→    \"productName\": \"Continue\",\n   101→    \"title\": \"Acquired by Cursor - No Active June 2025 Updates\",\n   102→    \"description\": \"Continue.dev has been acquired by Cursor, and the main website now redirects to information about this acquisition. No specific updates were found for June 2025